From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ezra Kruger <ekruges@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 07:02:38 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] config: psycho_* directives

psycho_genie_duration <ms>, psycho_titlebar_buttons,
psycho_double_click_titlebar, psycho_snap_edges,
psycho_snap_margin <px>, psycho_chips. All optional; defaults match
the shipped behavior (140ms genie, everything on, 10px margin).
Colors intentionally reuse client.* and the bar workspace classes.
---
 include/config_directives.h     |  6 +++++
 include/configuration.h         | 10 ++++++++
 parser-specs/config.spec        | 36 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/click.c                     |  3 ++-
 src/config.c                    |  6 +++++
 src/config_directives.c         | 24 +++++++++++++++++++
 src/deco_buttons.c              |  3 +++
 src/floating.c                  | 12 ++++++----
 src/ipc.c                       | 42 +++++++++++++++++----------------
 testcases/t/201-config-parser.t |  6 +++++
 10 files changed, 122 insertions(+), 26 deletions(-)

diff --git a/include/config_directives.h b/include/config_directives.h
